1
00:00:00,306 --> 00:00:02,606
(Raj:)It was a card for your 18th birthday.

2
00:00:02,775 --> 00:00:07,875
Inside it said, "Happy birthday, Howard.
I love you. Dad."

3
00:00:09,048 --> 00:00:10,778
Oh, and it was a "Far Side" card...

4
00:00:10,950 --> 00:00:14,820
(Raj:)...the one where the frog has its tongue
stuck to the underside of an airplane.

5
00:00:16,722 --> 00:00:18,782
(Raj:)Thinks it's a fly.

6
00:00:19,558 --> 00:00:21,388
(Raj:)Silly frog. So funny.

7
00:00:23,629 --> 00:00:24,649
Sheldon?

8
00:00:26,299 --> 00:00:27,959
(Sheldon:)It was a map...

9
00:00:28,134 --> 00:00:32,734
(Sheldon:)...leading to the lost treasure
of famous pirate "One-Eyed Willy."

10
00:00:35,408 --> 00:00:38,208
(Howard:)Nice try. That's the plot for Goonies.

11
00:00:39,211 --> 00:00:41,141
- Told you.
- Don't.

12
00:00:41,948 --> 00:00:43,138
(Penny:)Amy?

13
00:00:45,751 --> 00:00:47,581
(Amy:)You didn't know it...

14
00:00:47,753 --> 00:00:51,583
(Amy:)...but your father was in the auditorium
at your high school graduation...

15
00:00:51,757 --> 00:00:54,127
(Amy:)...and he cried
because he was so proud of you.

16
00:00:55,094 --> 00:00:56,154
(Penny:)Really?

17
00:00:56,329 --> 00:01:02,019
(Sheldon:)Or that's complete poppycock which Amy
made up. It still could be the map.

